   "lines": [
    "Still in the house.",
    "Emlen has been",
    "very touching",
    "about his love",
    "for Grace Parish.",
    "Dear old fellow!",
    "I wish him",
    "every success,",
    "with all my",
    "heart.",
    "Old Nell seems",
    "to be doing",
    "very well.",
    "What a wonder-",
    "ful set of rela-",
    "-tions I have got -",
    "cousins and all,",
    "especially my own family."
   ],
